think I HELD THIS BACK FOUR TIMES BECAUSE IT IS A FLEET HABIT RATHER THAN A LAP, and Keaton's word is what it wanted. Measured before writing any law: construction/ITINERARY.md read OVER its 40,960 bound five times on 20260917 -- 0158, 1848, 2010, 2044, 2211 -- and stood at 39,785 with 1,175 of headroom against lap accounts running 2,000 to 3,900. The next account overflows BY CONSTRUCTION, whoever writes it.
think A BOUND STATES A CAPACITY AND THESE PAGES WANTED A RULE ABOUT ARRIVAL. The tree had already ruled raising it wrong, twice, in an account folded off the ledger: a bound is the wrong instrument for a page whose rows do not close. It forecast its own failure and was right.
think THE FLEET HAD HALF-INVENTED THE CURE. Nineteen pointers reading shelved whole or born on its shelf already stood on the card, so several seats shed their elders. What this seats is uniformity, and the distribution is why that matters -- pheromone 6 blocks, bakery 4, copal 4, against petrichor, patchouli and incense at 1. Five of eight held more than one. A page whose arrival rule three seats follow still overflows.
obs THE SCAN CORRECTED MY OWN ARITHMETIC MID-LAP. My first reading, a throwaway python walk, put seat blocks at 14,506 bytes; the scan reads 9,817, because it closes a block at a Markdown heading where my walk ran on. The scan STATES its rule in its header, so it is the authority and the earlier figure was mine to drop. Writing the reading before the law is what caught it.
obs INCENSE WAS ALREADY COMPLIANT ON THE LAP THAT SEATS THE LAW, at 1 block and 217 bytes, the smallest of eight -- because this seat shed its two landed accounts an hour earlier to unblock the pier. That is the convention working before it was written down rather than a coincidence worth boasting about.
obs IT REPORTS AND GATES NOTHING. A gate over a page eight hands write would refuse a peer's honest lap for a total that peer reads only after writing, which is the shape derived-spine names as a gate somebody turns off. Whether a ceiling follows is Keaton's word once the distribution has been watched.
obs THE FASCIA WAS FOLLOWED RATHER THAN LEFT: the baton gains the clause so it reaches every ship with no per-seat edit, the-baton.md's PINS row names the new law beside checkpoint and debride, and the Cursor twin stands with its own front matter.
